								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=1752.msg23962#msg23962"><img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Themes/safgrey105/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=1752.msg23962#msg23962">SUPPORT RAJNII - STOP POLICE BRUTALITY!!!</a></b>
									<div class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> April 09, 2007, 01:49:00 pm &#187;</div></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;">Transmitting live from South Seattle, WA.<br /><br />Teaching artists should not be sent to jail for asking about the well-being of their students.&nbsp; The madness has to stop.&nbsp; Come through tomorrow!!!<br /><br />TUESDAY, APRIL 10TH @ 2:30PM, AT KING COUNTY CORRECTIONAL FACILITY, 500 5TH AVE<br /><br />Rajnii&#039;s personal account is below... if you know my music, you know Rajnii.&nbsp; If you know Rajnii, you know there aren&#039;t that many people more committed to justice, truth-telling and raising up the next generation than him.&nbsp; <br /><br /><br /><br />ON APRIL 5TH APPROX 3:30PM ON RAINIER AND HENDERSON OUT SIDE RAINIER BEACH HIGHSCHOOL I WITNESSED A HUGE GROUP OF POLICE JUST OUTSIDE THE GATE OF LAKE WASHINGTON APTS.<br />&nbsp;<br />&nbsp;AS I WALKED TOWARD THE SCHOOL I SAW ONE OF THE CAST MEMBERS IN THE PLAY I&#039;M DIRECTING, TIA HOLIDAY AND SHE TOLD&nbsp; ME HER CLASSMATE WAS BEING ARRESTED FOR SPITTING OUT A PIECE OF GUM.<br />I TURNED TO SEE ONE MALE OFFICER PLACING THE GIRL IN CUFFS INTO THE BACK OF A SQUAD CAR WHILE TWO OTHER MALE OFFICERS STOOD BY THE OFFICER (I CAME LATER TO KNOW WAS OFFICER NELSON I WAS CONCERNED THAT THE GIRL&#039;S PARENTS SHOULD BE NOTIFIED). AND VERY SLOWLY SO AS NOT TO APPEAR A THREAT I APPROACHED THE OFFICERS TO FIND OUT THAT INFORMATION.&nbsp; OFFICER NELSON WAS NOW IN THE FRONT SEAT ON THE RADIO.&nbsp; I SAID EXCUSE ME OFFICER I AM A TEACHING ARTIST DIRECTING A PLAY HERE AT RAINIER BEACH AND WOULD LIKE TO KNOW WHAT THE GIRL IS BEING CHARGED AND AM CONCERNED ABOUT HER SAFETY.<br />I WAS ASKED WHAT MY RELATIONSHIP TO THE GIRL WAS.<br />I SAID SHE IS ONE OF MY STUDENTS&#039; CLASSMATES.<br />I WAS TOLD TO BACK UP BY OFFICER NELSON.<br />I DID BACK UP.<br />I ASKED AGAIN.<br />I WAS TOLD BY OFFICER ATOFAU TO BACK UP AS WELL.<br />I DID.<br />I ASKED AGAIN.<br />OFFICER NELSON GOT OUT OF HIS VEHICLE<br />GRABBED MY RIGHT ARM BEHIND MY BACK AND SLIGHTLY TWISTED IT AND HELD IT FOR SEVERAL SECONDS AS IF TO INSTIGATE SOME RESPONSE OR RESISTANCE.<br />WHEN I DID NOT RESIST<br />I WAS RELEASED AND TOLD TO PUT MY HANDS ON THE HOOD OF THE SQUAD CAR.<br />I THEN ASKED THE GIRL IN CUSTODY WHAT SHE WAS BEING CHARGED WITH.<br />SHE DID NOT RESPOND.<br />OFFICER NELSON ASKED ME MY NAME I GAVE IT.<br />AND TOLD HIM I HAVE NO RECORD AND REITERATED I AM A TEACHING ARTIST DIRECTING A PLAY HERE AT RAINIER BEACH.<br />OFFICER NELSON PROMPTED OFFICER ATOFAU TO CHECK ME FOR DRUGS AND WEAPONS.<br />MY POCKETS WERE EMPTIED AND MY BAG TAKEN<br />I WAS THEN TOLD BY OFFICER NELSON I WAS GOING TO JAIL TOO.<br />I ASKED FOR WHAT<br />AND WAS TOLD FOR INTERFERING.<br />I SAID THIS IS RIDICULOUS.<br />I JUST WANT TO MAKE SURE THE GIRL IS SAFE AND THAT HER PARENTS ARE NOTIFIED I HAVE NO RECORD AND I HAVE COMPLIED WITH YOUR REQUESTS.<br />I WAS PUT IN CUFFS AND TAKEN BY OFFICER ATOFAU TO THE OTHER<br />SQUAD CAR.<br />I YELLED TO TIA TO TELL BRANDIE FLOOD THE TRAINER ON TOBACCO THAT I HAD BEEN UNJUSTLY ARRESTED AND TO NOTIFY MY MOTHER.<br />I STILL HAD NOT BEEN READ MY RIGHTS OR GIVEN A CLEAR INDICATION OF WHAT MY OFFENSE HAD BEEN.<br />I WAS TAKEN TO THE SOUTH PRECINCT AND HELD IN CUSTODY FOR ABOUT 30MINUTES I BELIEVE<br />BEFORE MY RIGHTS WERE READ TO ME BY MY OFFICER ATOFAU.<br />SARGENT MCGINNIS AND OFFICER ATOFAU RETURNED TO GET<br />MY VERSION OF WHAT HAPPENED.<br />OFFICER NELSON AND OFFICER MCRAE CAME TO EXPRESSS NELSON VERSION OF WHAT HAD OCCURRED TO JUSTIFY MY ARREST.<br />I WAS TAKEN TO KING COUNTY APPROX 6:30PM STILL UNAWARE OF WHAT MY EXACT CHARGES WERE.<br />MY BELONGINGS WERE TRANSFERRED TO A PLASTIC BAG AND I WAS TOLD I WOULD HAVE TO RETRIEVE MY PUMA BAG FROM A SITE ON AIRPORT WAY.<br />&nbsp;I WAS TOLD TO CHANGE INTO RED JAIL CLOTHING AND GIVEN A<br />SACK LUNCH AND PLACED IN A CELL.<br />FOR THE NEXT 5 1/2 HRS I WAS&nbsp; TRANSFERRED FROM CELL TO CELL AND FINALLY RELEASED AT MIDNIGHT TO DISCOVER I HAD A HEARING FOR OBSTRUCTION OF A PUBLIC OFFICIAL.<br />THIS WAS THE FIRST TIME I WAS INFORMED OF WHAT I HAD BEEN ARRESTED FOR.<br />PLEASE ATTEND OR WRITE A LETTER OF REFERENCE<br />to <a href="mailto:rajniie@yahoo.com">rajniie@yahoo.com</a><br />Please call KOMO KIRO ALL MEDIA SOURCES<br />FLOOD THEM WITH THIS STORY<br />&nbsp;- FOR QUESTIONS ON A CHILD&#039;S BEHALF<br />&nbsp;A TEACHER MUST BE ARRESTED?!<br />MY HEARING IS ON APRIL 10TH @2:30PM 500 5TH AVE KING COUNTY CORRECTIONAL FACILITY.<br />PLEASE SUPPORT!<br />I GREATLY APPRECIATE IT!<br />&nbsp;<br />PEACE,<br />&nbsp;<br />RAJNII</div>
